  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "It is music time at school. Teacher Kim has a game. \"Be an animal!\" she says. \"I say the animal.\" \"You do it with your body.\" Lily and Leo stand. Mia stands too. \"Let's start!\"",
      "\"Be a cat!\" says Teacher Kim. Lily walks like a cat. She is very small. \"Be a chicken!\" Leo moves his arms. He has a silly face. \"Do chickens clap?\" asks Mia. \"No!\" says Leo. \"I have no hands!\"",
      "\"Be a cow!\" says Teacher Kim. Mia walks with big feet. Her legs are big. Lily jumps like a frog. \"That is not a cow,\" says Mia. Pip comes into the room. \"Be a dog!\" says Lily. \"Woof!\" says Pip. \"Pip is a dog,\" says Mia. Teacher Kim smiles."
    ],
    "summary": "Teacher Kim plays an animal action game. The children move like a cat, a chicken, and a cow, and Pip is a dog.",
